---
description: Astro Symposium Site Lite conventions
globs: ["src/**"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read AGENTS.md first. Astro 7 + Tailwind 4, static, no JavaScript.
- All content lives in src/event.config.ts (programme, speakers, venue, registration fees).
- Use token utilities (bg-paper, bg-paper-2, text-ink, text-ink-2, border-line, text-stamp); no raw hex, radius 0, no shadows.
- Run `npx astro check` and `npm run build` before finishing.
